Package: dvsb
Title: Disease Variability in Subpopulations from Biomarkers
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Chris", "Wymant", , "chris.wymant@bdi.ox.ac.uk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates the prevalence of disease and how it varies between
    subpopulations, using raw uncalibrated proxy measurements of biomarkers
    (e.g. optical density measurements from ELISA experiments, for
    seroprevalence).
